<h1>Investors</h1>

<p>Meridian Castings Limited is a private company, wholly owned by the Coulthard family trust. While we do not have publicly traded shares, we publish a summary of group financial performance each year for the benefit of lenders, credit insurers and long-term customers who require it as part of their own supplier review process.</p>

<div class="stat-grid">
    <div class="stat">
        <p class="stat-value">&pound;96.4m</p>
        <p class="stat-label">Group revenue, financial year 2025</p>
    </div>
    <div class="stat">
        <p class="stat-value">860</p>
        <p class="stat-label">Employees across three sites</p>
    </div>
    <div class="stat">
        <p class="stat-value">63</p>
        <p class="stat-label">Years in operation</p>
    </div>
</div>

<p>Financial statements are filed annually with Companies House under company number 00841766. Governance matters are overseen by the board, chaired by James Coulthard, with financial reporting led by Chief Financial Officer Priya Anand.</p>

<p>Requests for financial information beyond our filed accounts should be directed through our <a href="/contact">contact page</a>. For background on the company and its leadership, see <a href="/leadership">leadership</a>.</p>
